<h3>2026-10-29 — Meal owns the plate</h3>
<p class="doc-body"><strong>What.</strong> The Health Kitchen plan now says the meal is not a todo. The calendar keeps the clock and the prep alarm. The plate, stock, and who ate it stay in Health Kitchen.</p>
<p class="doc-body"><strong>Why.</strong> The dashboard was showing Breakfast and plate. The card must name the actual main course. Marking a recurring todo done would lock the template, not that day.</p>
<p class="doc-body"><strong>Files.</strong> <code>root/Documentation/HealthKitchenPlan.tt</code>.</p>
